<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Louise's Finance Portfolio</title>
    <style>
        body { 
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; 
            background-color: #f4f6f8; 
            color: #333; 
            line-height: 1.6; 
            margin: 0; 
            padding: 40px 20px; 
        }
        .container { 
            max-width: 800px; 
            margin: 0 auto; 
        }
        header { 
            text-align: center; 
            margin-bottom: 40px; 
        }
        h1 { 
            color: #1a365d; 
            margin-bottom: 10px; 
        }
        .subtitle { 
            color: #666; 
            font-size: 1.1em; 
        }
        .card { 
            background: #fff; 
            padding: 25px; 
            border-radius: 8px; 
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); 
            margin-bottom: 25px; 
            border-left: 4px solid #2b6cb0; 
        }
        .card h2 { 
            margin-top: 0; 
            color: #2b6cb0; 
            font-size: 1.3em; 
        }
        .tag { 
            font-size: 0.85em; 
            color: #718096; 
            text-transform: uppercase; 
            letter-spacing: 1px; 
            margin-bottom: 10px; 
            display: inline-block;
        }
        strong { color: #2d3748; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>Louise (Yu Lu)</h1>
            <div class="subtitle">Finance Student · Class of 2026 · Email: 18107798138@163.com</div>
        </header>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="tag">Group Coursework</div>
            <h2>Financial Statement Analysis Webpage</h2>
            <p><strong>My Role:</strong> Focused on defining the analytical metrics and presenting conclusions.</p>
            <p><strong>Overview:</strong> Built a web-based tool to analyze the earnings quality of A-share manufacturing companies. Conducted preliminary data processing and financial metric logic design (e.g., cash flow vs. net income).</p>
            <!-- 在这里插入截图： <img src="https://github.com/Louise0819/Louise0819.github.io/blob/main/Financial%20Statement%20Analysis%20Webpage.png" width="100%"> -->
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="tag">Personal Workflow Tool</div>
            <h2>Internship Information Management Platform</h2>
            <p><strong>The Problem:</strong> Internship postings are scattered across WeChat groups and websites, making them easy to miss and hard to compare.</p>
            <p><strong>My Solution:</strong> Designed a structured tracking system to manage XX+ opportunities, tracking key variables like application deadlines, role types, and return offer potential to improve decision-making efficiency.</p>
            <!-- 在这里插入截图： <img src="https://github.com/Louise0819/Louise0819.github.io/blob/main/Internship%20Information%20Management%20Platform.png" width="100%"> -->
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="tag">Tech Exploration</div>
            <h2>AI-Assisted Information Processing (DeepSeek via QQ)</h2>
            <p><strong>Overview:</strong> Integrated an AI model into a chat interface to assist with preliminary financial information processing, such as summarizing research reports or reading announcements.</p>
            <p><strong>Risk Management:</strong> I use AI for initial screening only; final investment/analysis conclusions are always verified against the original source documents.</p>
            <!-- 在这里插入截图： <img src="https://github.com/Louise0819/Louise0819.github.io/blob/main/Deepseek%20via%20QQ.png" width="100%"> -->
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
